<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Important<sp/>Notes</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Use<sp/>an<sp/>oscilloscope<sp/>to<sp/>observe<sp/>synchronized<sp/>updates</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Watch<sp/>deadband<sp/>transitions<sp/>on<sp/>complementary<sp/>pairs</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>All<sp/>updates<sp/>occur<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>next<sp/>global<sp/>load<sp/>event</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Period<sp/>remains<sp/>constant<sp/>during<sp/>updates</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Steps<sp/>to<sp/>Run<sp/>the<sp/>Example</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Import<sp/>and<sp/>build<sp/>the<sp/>CCS<sp/>project</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Connect<sp/>an<sp/>oscilloscope<sp/>to<sp/>observe<sp/>the<sp/>specified<sp/>GPIO<sp/>pins</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Launch<sp/>a<sp/>CCS<sp/>debug<sp/>session</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">4.<sp/>Run<sp/>the<sp/>executable</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">5.<sp/>Observe<sp/>the<sp/>synchronized<sp/>parameter<sp/>updates<sp/>across<sp/>all<sp/>channels</highlight></codeline>
